1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Skip scoring and you may optimize a broken reward.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Sampling asks for drug-like molecules. Discovery asks: worth making?

3
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Scoring turns objectives into one number in zero to one.

4
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Components compute. Transforms map into zero to one.

5
00:01:25,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Filters zero globally. Geometric mean is harsh on weak scores.

6
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:25,000
run_type scoring needs no prior — evaluate molecules you have.

7
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Debug the reward once before RL calls it thousands of times.

8
00:02:45,000 --> 00:03:20,000
96 molecules. QED plus MW double sigmoid 200 to 500.

9
00:03:20,000 --> 00:04:05,000
CustomAlerts. About two seconds on CPU. scoring.csv.

10
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:40,000
Mean 0.66. Max 0.97. Forty-four molecules above 0.8.

11
00:04:40,000 --> 00:05:20,000
One alert scored zero. MW 151 collapsed via the transform.

12
00:05:20,000 --> 00:06:00,000
Full tutorial on the site. Code on GitHub.

13
